ar-transcript.pdf?rev=ec1c2a1662eb4f2388f13f19a613af74"><span class="nel-Link-5" data-ref="linkContent"><div class="sc-64acf168-5 dNAnxe"><span>Annual Results 2022/23 Webinar Transcript</span></div><small data-ref="text" class="sc-966758-8 sc-64acf168-6 cenBbK goOVFS nel-Typography-457 nel-Typography-451">PDF<!-- -->, <!-- -->173KB<!-- --> (opens in a new window)</small></span></a></div><hr aria-hidden="true" class="sc-a25c4a33-0 sc-64acf168-7 DEQpA bQwCGX"/></li><li class="sc-64acf168-0 ctfydM"><div class="sc-64acf168-3 biiOAs"><a class="sc-966758-19 sc-64acf168-4 bnhTnO cNUzOD nel-Link-4 nel-Link-3" data-ref="link" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" href="/-/assets/nationwidecouk/documents/investor-relations/previous-results-webinar-transcripts/interim-results-2022-23-webinar-transcript.pdf?rev=cd93042d9d4f44cb8a73dd3b2ebd8fd5"><span class="nel-Link-6 nel-Link-7"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="nel-Link-8 nel-Icon-443 nel-Icon-442" data-ref="link.icon" focusable="false" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M11 13.586V3a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v10.59l2.295-2.295a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 1.414l-3.993 3.993a1.01 1.01 0 0 1-1.428 0L7.295 12.71a1 1 0 1 1 1.414-1.414L11 13.585ZM2 21a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h18a1 1 0 1 1 0 2H3a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z"></path></svg></span><span class="nel-Link-5" data-ref="linkContent"></span></a><a class="sc-72688533-0 jagpcm sc-72688533-1 sc-64acf168-2 exegsl daJFWv nel-Link-4 nel-Link-3" data-ref="link" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-testid="TextLink" target="_blank" href="/-/assets/nationwidecouk/documents/investor-relations/previous-results-webinar-transcripts/interim-results-2022-23-webinar-transcript.pdf?rev=cd93042d9d4f44cb8a73dd3b2ebd8fd5"><span class="nel-Link-5" data-ref="linkContent"><div class="sc-64acf168-5 dNAnxe"><span>Interim Results 2022/23 Webinar Transcript</span></div><small data-ref="text" class="sc-966758-8 sc-64acf168-6 cenBbK goOVFS nel-Typography-457 nel-Typography-451">PDF<!-- -->, <!-- -->197KB<!-- --> (opens in a new window)</small></span></a></div><hr aria-hidden="true" class="sc-a25c4a33-0 sc-64acf168-7 DEQpA bQwCGX"/></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div data-component="RichText" class="sc-b0b5e28a-0 fwbEDY sc-c5496b0-0 hRoPvw vertical-rhythm--richText passthru"><p>You can view the European Single Electronic Format (ESEF) versions of our Annual Report and Accounts 2026, and results and financial records dating back over 20 years, on our <a href="/about-us/governance-reports-and-results/results-and-accounts">Results and Accounts page</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="ContentContainer" class="sc-df0903fa-0 kCztEJ"><div class="sc-a9d5dca5-0 IgGBL"><div class="sc-df0903fa-0 dlmMWh"><div class="sc-966758-37 sc-4b0d63e5-0 hKBzFm eqZWMk nel-Grid-31 nel-Grid-30" data-ref="grid"><div class="sc-966758-38 sc-4b0d63e5-1 byaSwp fmVxVc nel-Grid-33 nel-Grid-80 nel-Grid-109 nel-Grid-30" data-ref="gridColumn"><div data-component="VerticalRhythm" class="sc-e6cf42dd-0 bHjYhb"><div class="sc-b14659e4-0 bcxJFt vertical-rhythm--sublayout"><div data-component="VerticalRhythm" class="sc-e6cf42dd-0 bHjYhb"><div class="sc-966758-37 hKBzFm vertical-rhythm--image-with-content nel-Grid-31 nel-Grid-30" data-ref="grid" data-component="ImageWithContent" data-analytics-context="true"><div class="sc-966758-38 byaSwp sc-db11453-0 Tdmz nel-Grid-33 nel-Grid-80 nel-Grid-109 nel-Grid-188 nel-Grid-30" data-ref="gridColumn"><div class="sc-cedc80cb-0 sc-76acecad-0 cicUwH exystf"><div><span class="" style="display:inline-block"></span></div><small data-ref="text" class="sc-966758-8 cenBbK nel-Typography-457 nel-Typography-451"></small></div></div><div class="sc-966758-38 byaSwp sc-db11453-1 BZNLV nel-Grid-33 nel-Grid-80 nel-Grid-109 nel-Grid-192 nel-Grid-30" data-ref="gridColumn"><div data-component="VerticalRhythm" class="sc-e6cf42dd-0 bHjYhb"><h2 data-component="Heading2" data-analytics-context="true" class="sc-966758-0 fTEWKI vertical-rhythm--h2 nel-Typography-464 nel-Typography-451" data-ref="heading">Bringing Nationwide and Virgin Money together</h2><div data-component="RichText" class="sc-b0b5e28a-0 fwbEDY sc-c5496b0-0 hRoPvw vertical-rhythm--richText passthru"><p>For information on the Part VII transfer of Virgin Money's assets and liabilities to Nationwide Building Society,  <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="http://uk.virginmoney.com/nationwide-transfer" target="_blank">visit Virgin Money's transfer page</a></p>
<p>If you have any questions about the transfer or how it could impact you, please contact us at <a href="mailto:treasury-virginmoney-transfer@nationwide.co.uk">treasury-virginmoney-transfer@nationwide.co.uk</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="ContentContainer" class="sc-df0903fa-0 iSMQQM"><div class="sc-a9d5dca5-0 hOzheg"><div class="sc-df0903fa-0 dLUYwV"><div class="sc-966758-37 sc-4b0d63e5-0 hKBzFm eqZWMk nel-Grid-31 nel-Grid-30" data-ref="grid"><div class="sc-966758-38 sc-4b0d63e5-1 byaSwp fmVxVc nel-Grid-33 nel-Grid-80 nel-Grid-109 nel-Grid-30" data-ref="gridColumn"><div data-component="VerticalRhythm" class="sc-e6cf42dd-0 bHjYhb"><div class="sc-b14659e4-0 hRudQy vertical-rhythm--sublayout"><div data-component="VerticalRhythm" class="sc-e6cf42dd-0 bHjYhb"><h2 data-component="Heading2" data-analytics-context="true" id="funding-programmes" class="sc-966758-0 fTEWKI vertical-rhythm--h2 nel-Typography-464 nel-Typography-451" data-ref="heading">Funding programmes</h2><div data-component="CardsGrid" data-analytics-context="true" class="vertical-rhythm--card sc-76153301-0 sc-b7956685-0 hPXYas bqrJGJ"><section data-component="CardLinkList" data-analytics-context="true" class="sc-cedc80cb-0 sc-c7a400c3-0 hgRIkv bNYkZy"><h3 class="sc-966758-0 fTEWKI nel-Typography-467 nel-Typography-451" data-ref="heading">Unsecured funding and capital</h3><ul class="sc-966758-35 sc-c7a400c3-1 gsLBcz gWziVx nel-List-470 nel-List-473 nel-List-469" data-ref="list" role="list"><li class="sc-966758-36 iDeaSs nel-List-472"><a class="sc-72688533-0 jagpcm sc-72688533-1 sc-38daf7e3-0 exegsl SXrbR nel-Link-4 nel-Link-3" data-ref="link" data-testid="TextLink" href="/investor-relations/emtn-terms-of-access"><span class="nel-Link-5" data-ref="linkContent">EMTN programme</span></a></li><li class="sc-966758-36 iDeaSs nel-List-472"><a class="sc-72688533-0 jagpcm sc-72688533-1 sc-38daf7e3-0 exegsl SXrbR nel-Link-4 nel-Link-3" data-ref="link" d