<p>Silverstone Master Issuer RMBS (Fixed Rate Issues): SILVMA</p>
<p>You can view the <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.virginmoneyukplc.com/investor-relations/debt-investors/credit-ratings/" target="_blank">Virgin Money UK credit ratings page (opens in a new window)</a>.</p></div><hr data-component="Separator" class="sc-a25c4a33-0 bZdfuL"/><h2 data-component="Heading2" data-analytics-context="true" id="responsible-business" class="sc-966758-0 fTEWKI vertical-rhythm--h2 nel-Typography-464 nel-Typography-451" data-ref="heading">Responsible business</h2><div data-component="RichText" class="sc-b0b5e28a-0 fwbEDY sc-c5496b0-0 hRoPvw vertical-rhythm--richText passthru"><p>Being a responsible business and contributing to society are integral to who we are and what we do. Find out how we&rsquo;re making positive social and environmental impacts underpinned by robust governance.</p></div><div class="nel-Accordion-498 nel-Accordion-497" data-component="Accordion" data-analytics-context="true"><div class="nel-Accordion-499" data-ref="accordion"><h3 class="nel-Accordion-497 nel-Typography-465 nel-Typography-451" data-ref="heading"><button aria-controls="panel-6ae8f26d-a218-4623-835b-e5bfdcd7ace2" aria-expanded="false" class="nel-Accordion-500 nel-Accordion-497" data-ref="accordionHeader" id="title-6ae8f26d-a218-4623-835b-e5bfdcd7ace2" type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="24px" width="24px" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="nel-Accordion-502 nel-Icon-443 nel-Icon-444 nel-Icon-442" data-ref="accordionIcon.icon" focusable="false" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"><path d="M18.707 9.707a1 1 0 0 0-1.414-1.414L12 13.586 6.707 8.293a1 1 0 0 0-1.414 1.414l6 6a1 1 0 0 0 1.414 0l6-6Z"></path></svg><span class="nel-Accordion-501" data-ref="accordionHeading">Our latest ESG disclosures</span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="title-6ae8f26d-a218-4623-835b-e5bfdcd7ace2" class="nel-Accordion-503" data-ref="accordionContent" id="panel-6ae8f26d-a218-4623-835b-e5bfdcd7ace2" role="region" style="display:none