295-2.295a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 1.414l-3.993 3.993a1.01 1.01 0 0 1-1.428 0L7.295 12.71a1 1 0 1 1 1.414-1.414L11 13.585ZM2 21a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h18a1 1 0 1 1 0 2H3a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z"></path></svg></span><span class="nel-Link-5" data-ref="linkContent"></span></a><a class="sc-72688533-0 jagpcm sc-72688533-1 sc-64acf168-2 exegsl daJFWv nel-Link-4 nel-Link-3" data-ref="link" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-testid="TextLink" target="_blank" href="/-/assets/nationwidecouk/documents/about/how-we-are-run/results-and-accounts/2022-2023/climate-related-financial-disclosures-2023.pdf?rev=1bf60051ca254223b0fab38e8220eebb"><span class="nel-Link-5" data-ref="linkContent"><div class="sc-64acf168-5 dNAnxe"><span>Climate-related Financial Disclosures 2023 </span></div><small data-ref="text" class="sc-966758-8 sc-64acf168-6 cenBbK goOVFS nel-Typography-457 nel-Typography-451">PDF<!-- -->, <!-- -->9.7MB<!-- --> (opens in a new window)</small></span></a></div><hr aria-hidden="true" class="sc-a25c4a33-0 sc-64acf168-7 DEQpA bQwCGX"/></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-b14659e4-0 hstXKx vertical-rhythm--sublayout"><div data-component="VerticalRhythm" class="sc-e6cf42dd-0 bHjYhb"><h2 data-component="Heading2" data-analytics-context="true" id="ESG" class="sc-966758-0 fTEWKI vertical-rhythm--h2 nel-Typography-464 nel-Typography-451" data-ref="heading">Environmental, social and governance (ESG) ratings  </h2><div data-component="RichText" class="sc-b0b5e28a-0 fwbEDY sc-c5496b0-0 hRoPvw vertical-rhythm--richText passthru"><p>We engage with ESG rating agencies and regularly participate in ESG surveys and assessments. Whilst we review and respond to all incoming queries, following investor feedback, we are most actively engaged with the following agencies.</p></div><div class="nel-505 sc-61f1e4f5-0 sc-4ee983ff-0 fqxlDl hjGbKp vertical-rhythm--section" data-testid="NelTable"><table data-component="SimpleTable" data-analytics-context="true" class="nel-506">
    <caption><small>This table shows the rating provider, the rating scale, our rating and when it was achieved.</small></caption>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th scope="col">
            <p>ESG Assessment</p>
