st update\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/th\u003e\n        \u003c/tr\u003e\n    \u003c/thead\u003e\n    \u003ctbody\u003e\n        \u003ctr\u003e\n            \u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eMSCI ESG Rating*\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/th\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eAAA to CCC\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eAAA\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eMarch 2026\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n        \u003c/tr\u003e\n        \u003ctr\u003e\n            \u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eMorningstar Sustainalytics ESG Risk Rating** \u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/th\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003e0-100, Negligible to Severe\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003e6.9, Negligible Risk\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eJuly 2026\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n        \u003c/tr\u003e\n        \u003ctr\u003e\n            \u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003e\u003ca rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.issgovernance.com/esg/ratings/\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eISS ESG Rating (opens in new window)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/th\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eA+ to D-\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eC+, Prime\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eApril 2026\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n        \u003c/tr\u003e\n        \u003ctr\u003e\n            \u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eCDP Climate Change Disclosure\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/th\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eA to D-\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eB\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eDecember\u0026nbsp;2025\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n        \u003c/tr\u003e\n        \u003ctr\u003e\n            \u003cth scope=\"row\"\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eS\u0026amp;P Global ESG Score\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/th\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003e0-100\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003e66\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n            \u003ctd\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eJanuary 2026\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/td\u003e\n        \u003c/tr\u003e\n    \u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e"}}},{"uid":"c409ba64-6558-43e6-b9db-9db6e68d2828","componentName":"SmallPrint","dataSource":"{5E40A05C-3A3C-456D-99A0-4F4F996CEB73}","params":{},"fields":{"content":{"value":"\u003cp\u003e*The use by Nationwide of any MSCI ESG Research LLC or its affiliates (\u0026ldquo;MSCI\u0026rdquo;) data, and the use of MSCI logos, trademarks, service marks or index names herein, do not constitute a sponsorship, endorsement, recommendation, or promotion of Nationwide by MSCI. MSCI services and data are the property of MSCI or its information providers, and are provided \u0026lsquo;as-is\u0026rsquo; and without warranty.  MSCI names and logos are trademarks or service marks of MSCI. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e**Copyright \u0026copy;2026 Sustainalytics, a Morningstar company. All rights reserved. This publication includes information and data provided by Sustainalytics and/or its content providers. Information provided by Sustainalytics is not directed to or intended for use or distribution to India-based clients or users and its distribution to Indian resident individuals or entities is not permitted. Morningstar/